The record is unambiguous. The task required one file with a slugify function and 5 unit tests within 24 hours. The submission section states plainly: "No submission was made." The requester followed up before the deadline (hour 20) and confirmed non-delivery after it (hour 30). The worker delivered nothing and offered no explanation or response.

With zero work product, there is nothing to review against requirements and nothing a "redo" could correct — the worker never engaged at all. Paying the worker in full would reward total non-performance. The only fair outcome is a full refund to the requester.

{"worker wins": 0, "redo": 0, "requester wins": 100}
